{
  "name": "Luis Alfredo — Agente WhatsApp Crefaz (UazAPI)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-sticky",
      "name": "⚙️ Configuração",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 60],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ O que configurar antes de ativar\n\n**1. Agente Luis Alfredo (FastAPI)**\n- Substitua `http://localhost:8000` pelo IP/URL do servidor\n- Se rodar local sem VPS: use ngrok para expor a porta 8000\n- Deixe `X-API-Secret` vazio se não definiu `AGENT_API_SECRET`\n\n**2. UazAPI — Envio**\n- Substitua `http://SEU_SERVIDOR_UAZAPI` pela URL da sua instância\n- Preencha `SUA_SESSION_KEY` (UUID do painel UazAPI)\n- Preencha `NOME_DA_SESSAO` (nome da sessão configurada)\n\n**3. UazAPI — Webhook de entrada**\n- No painel UazAPI, configure o webhook para:\n  `{URL_DO_SEU_N8N}/webhook/whatsapp-entrada`\n\n**4. Handover (opcional)**\n- Use o endpoint `POST /webhook/handoff` no servidor\n  quando um atendente humano assumir a conversa",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 440],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "whatsapp-entrada",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "responseData": "firstEntryJson"
      },
      "webhookId": "whatsapp-entrada-luis-alfredo"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-filter",
      "name": "É Mensagem Recebida?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [460, 440],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-wook",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.wook }}",
              "rightValue": "RECEIVE_MESSAGE",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-ignore",
      "name": "Ignorar (status/QR/etc)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [680, 560],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "node-normalize",
      "name": "Normalizar Payload UazAPI",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [680, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n// Converte o payload da UazAPI para o formato do agente Luis Alfredo.\n//\n// Campos UazAPI confirmados (webhook RECEIVE_MESSAGE):\n//   wook    → \"RECEIVE_MESSAGE\"\n//   sender  → número de quem enviou (ex: \"5585999999999\")\n//   content → texto da mensagem\n//   type    → \"text\" | \"image\" | \"document\" | \"audio\" | \"video\"\n//   session → nome da sessão\n// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nconst body = $input.first().json;\n\nconst messageType = (body.type || 'text').toLowerCase();\n\n// UazAPI não envia mime_type no webhook;\n// o agente detecta imagem/PDF pelo messageType (image, document)\nconst mimeType = '';\n\n// Handover: UazAPI não distingue mensagens do atendente humano\n// via webhook. Use o endpoint POST /webhook/handoff separado.\nconst isHuman = false;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    conversation_id: String(body.sender || ''),\n    message_type:    messageType,\n    text:            body.content || '',\n    mime_type:       mimeType,\n    is_human_agent:  isHuman,\n    timestamp:       null\n  }\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-call-agent",
      "name": "Chamar Agente Luis Alfredo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [900, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:8000/webhook/message",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-API-Secret",
              "value": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "body": "={{ $json }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-if-active",
      "name": "Agente Ativo?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-agent-active",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.agent_active }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equal"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-noop",
      "name": "Silêncio (SILENT/HANDOVER)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1340, 520],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "node-prepare",
      "name": "Preparar Mensagens",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1340, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Expande o array messages em itens individuais do n8n.\n// Cada item carrega: text, delay_seconds, conversation_id.\nconst conversationId = $input.first().json.conversation_id;\nconst messages       = $input.first().json.messages || [];\n\nreturn messages.map(m => ({\n  json: {\n    text:            m.text,\n    delay_seconds:   m.delay_seconds,\n    conversation_id: conversationId\n  }\n}));"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-split",
      "name": "Loop Mensagens",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1560, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-wait",
      "name": "Aguardar Delay",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1780, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "resume": "timeInterval",
        "amount": "={{ $json.delay_seconds }}",
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "webhookId": "wait-delay-luis-alfredo"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-send",
      "name": "Enviar Mensagem (UazAPI)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2000, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://SEU_SERVIDOR_UAZAPI/sendText",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "sessionkey",
              "value": "SUA_SESSION_KEY"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "body": "={{ JSON.stringify({ session: 'NOME_DA_SESSAO', number: $json.conversation_id, text: $json.text }) }}"
      }
    }
  ],
